              destruct P as [[A1 [A2 A3]] [B1 [B2 [B3 [B4 [B5 [B6 [B7 B8]]]]]]]];
              first [ clear A2 A3 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6; lia
                    | clear A1 A3 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6; lia
                    | clear A1 A2 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6; lia
                    | clear A1 A2 A3 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6; lia
